{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>鄺港傑 郭莎樂 青紅蘿蔔湯 蔡天鳳碎屍案｜28歲名媛蔡天鳳（Abby Choi）涉遭肢解案11月16日在高等法 …</p><p></p>\n<p>鄺港傑 郭莎樂 青紅蘿蔔湯 蔡天鳳碎屍案｜28歲名媛蔡天鳳（Abby Choi）涉遭肢解案11月16日在高等法院續審，控方繼續盤問首被告鄺港傑，焦點落在其胞弟鄺港智帶往健身的一套長袖衫褲。惟控方隨即提出另一項更尖銳質疑，令庭上攻防由衣物延伸至閉路電視中的神秘動作。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e5%82%91-%e9%84%ba%e7%90%83-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e6%99%ba-%e7%8d%84%e4%b8%ad%e4%bf%a1-14%e5%90%8b%e5%a4%a7%e6%b9%af%e7%85%b2-%e9%83%ad%e8%8e%8e%e6%a8%82-2455975/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜鄺港傑棄指控父親鄺球為兇手原因 揭買大湯煲作用 網民：笑到碌地</a></p>\n<h2>鄺港智長袖健身衣物成盤問焦點</h2>\n<p>代表控方的資深大律師郭莎樂盤問被告鄺港傑，被指是兇手的胞弟鄺港智在蔡天鳳失蹤當日離家時身穿短袖衫褲，其後到達龍尾村再換上深色長袖衫及長褲。鄺港傑早前供稱胞弟原定當天下午健身，控方遂質疑長袖長褲並非一般健身裝束，更追問該身衣物是否為了遮擋手腳，將看似普通的衣着細節推向案件關鍵疑點。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e5%82%91-%e9%80%a0%e5%81%87-%e7%8d%84%e4%b8%ad%e4%bf%a1-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e6%99%ba-%e9%84%ba%e7%90%83%e7%94%9f%e6%97%a5-2455192/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜鄺港傑認花2年造假終講真相 答「是否自認聰明」旁聽爆笑 鄺港智呈獄中信大踢爆</a></p>\n<p>鄺港傑回應指「真係有啲人着好厚又長嗰啲㗎喎」，並形容細佬鄺港智身體「弱雞」及「虧」，因此會穿長袖衫褲運動；庭上傳譯員分別把兩詞譯作「weak」及「fragile」。</p>\n<h2>鄺港傑否認示範擊打動作</h2>\n<p>當主控官郭莎樂播放案發當日（即蔡天鳳失蹤當日2023年2月21日）中午時分，他與胞弟鄺港智在新世紀廣場MOKO一起在星巴克咖啡店的閉路電視片段，質疑片中動作涉及示範擊打蔡天鳳時，鄺港傑否認相關說法，反指「律師太看圖作文啦」，又稱忘記該動作代表甚麼。郭莎樂指鄺港智當時在示範打死者蔡天鳳的動作。鄺港傑聞言即反問：「唔會喺呢啲地方吓嘛？講呢啲嘢，咁多人喺度。」他稱不會在人多場所談論或示範此類事情。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e5%85%87%e6%89%8b-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e5%82%91-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e6%99%ba-%e9%84%ba%e7%90%83-%e8%ac%80%e6%ae%ba%e6%a1%88-%e8%87%aa%e8%be%af-2454348/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜鄺港傑稱胞弟鄺港智殺害蔡天鳳 原因盤算部署惹熱議 網民揭開鄺家三父子自救方法</a></p>\n<h2>網民指鄺港傑不攻自破：佢講最後果句已經默認左</h2>\n<p>鄺港傑的供詞隨即引發網民熱議，特別是他反問主控官「唔會喺呢啲地方吓嘛？講呢啲嘢，咁多人喺度」一句，不少網民直指其說法自相矛盾，紛紛留言指鄺港傑不攻自破，「「咁多人喺度」⋯⋯所以咪做動作囉！不攻自破」、「其實佢講最後果句已經默認左」；更有人反問「即是人多不要講呢啲嘢？人少就可以講了！」與此同時，不少網民狠批其言行「真係好狡猾」、「所謂小聰明 其實仲蠢個豬」，亦有網民替辯方出招，笑言「個律師應該跟住問，（咁係邊度講呢d野先合適呀嘛）」。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e5%82%91-%e5%90%88%e7%85%a7-%e5%89%8d%e5%a4%a7%e4%bc%af-%e8%ad%9a%e6%96%b9%e9%a7%bf-%e8%a6%aa%e5%af%86%e6%9c%8b%e5%8f%8b-2450674/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳鄺港傑多張合照庭上曝光 譚方駿首回應二人真實關係 警公開鄺最後接觸蔡衣服</a></p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.sundaykiss.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179484343905921280_5023279966afb2330755ed.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"蔡天鳳 鄺港傑 28歲名媛蔡天鳳（Abby Choi）於2023年2月慘遭碎屍遇害，案件震驚全城。（圖片來源：IG@xxabbyc）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.sundaykiss.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179484343905921280_5023279966afb2330755ed.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>28歲名媛蔡天鳳（Abby Choi）於2023年2月慘遭碎屍遇害，案件震驚全城。（圖片來源：IG@xxabbyc）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e5%89%8d%e5%ae%b6%e7%bf%81%e9%84%ba%e7%90%83-%e8%aa%8d%e7%bd%aa-%e5%9f%8b%e8%91%ac%e5%b1%8d%e9%ab%94-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e5%82%91-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e6%99%ba-2450408/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜鄺球開庭前突改口認阻止合法埋葬屍體罪 原因及背後部署盤算惹熱議</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e5%89%8d%e5%a4%ab%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e6%99%ba-%e5%90%8d%e9%8c%b6-%e9%90%98%e9%8c%b6%e4%ba%a4%e6%98%93-%e9%99%b3%e4%ba%ae%e6%81%92-damon-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e5%82%91-2447584/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜前妻遇害後 名錶職員揭鄺港智異常舉止 提出1大古怪要求：我照做</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e8%ad%9a%e6%96%b9%e9%a7%bf-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e6%99%ba-%e6%ad%a4%e6%83%85%e4%b8%8d%e5%86%8d-%e9%90%98%e9%8c%b6%e7%94%9f%e6%84%8f-%e5%a5%b3%e5%85%92%e7%99%bc%e7%87%92-2446053/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜譚方駿稱與鄺港智「此情不再」剖白關係變化內情 1事令關係逆轉：我打咗個突</a>\n</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e8%ad%9a%e6%96%b9%e9%a7%bf-%e5%ad%90%e5%a5%b3-%e5%85%a8%e5%ae%b6%e7%a7%bb%e8%8b%b1-%e7%a7%bb%e6%b0%91%e8%8b%b1%e5%9c%8b-%e9%84%ba%e8%ad%9a%e5%ad%90%e5%a5%b3-%e9%84%ba-2445666/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜譚方駿首披露帶妻及4子女全家移英計劃 蔡天鳳拒鄺譚子女同住原因</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e8%ad%9a%e6%96%b9%e9%a7%bf-%e4%b8%88%e5%a4%ab-%e6%be%b3%e6%b4%b2%e7%95%99%e5%ad%b8-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e6%99%ba-%e7%b9%bc%e5%ad%90%e7%b9%bc%e5%a5%b3-2444979/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜譚方駿出庭作供剖白與蔡天鳳相識經過 揭蔡11字回應鄺港智突失蹤7年</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e5%82%91%e8%87%aa%e8%be%af-%e5%85%87%e6%89%8b%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e6%99%ba-%e9%84%ba%e7%90%83-%e6%8e%a5%e6%94%be%e5%ad%b8-%e4%b8%83%e4%ba%ba%e8%bb%8a-2454496/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜鄺港傑指證胞弟鄺港智為兇手 詳述蔡分半鐘遇害經過 鄺球得知後沉默數秒回應</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e7%9c%9f%e9%9d%a2%e7%9b%ae-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e5%82%91-%e8%ba%ab%e4%bb%bd%e7%89%b9%e6%ae%8a-%e5%89%8d%e5%a4%ab%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e6%99%ba-%e5%b0%8f%e7%94%b7%e4%ba%ba-2454105/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜鄺港傑自認家中身份特殊 揭蔡天鳳私下真面目 曾斥弟鄺港傑「似返個男人」</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e6%99%ba-%e5%85%a7%e5%9c%b0%e5%a5%b3%e5%8f%8b-%e5%8a%a0%e5%a4%9a%e5%88%a9%e5%b1%b1-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e5%82%91-%e9%84%ba%e7%90%83%e6%83%85%e5%a9%a6-2454035/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜鄺港傑爆胞弟有女友 蔡知情後曾向子女哭訴 鄺球被逐出豪宅「住情婦屋企」導火線</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e4%b8%88%e5%a4%ab%e8%ad%9a%e6%96%b9%e9%a7%bf-%e9%83%ad%e8%8e%8e%e6%a8%82-%e4%bc%91%e5%ba%ad-%e5%8a%a0%e5%a4%9a%e5%88%a9%e5%b1%b1%e7%89%a9%e6%a5%ad-%e5%89%8d%e5%ae%b6-2445324/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜蔡天鳳告知真相 譚方駿難過掩面 主控官提出休庭 鄺球於犯人欄疑哭泣</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e9%99%aa%e5%af%a9%e5%93%a1-%e5%81%a5%e5%ba%b7%e7%90%86%e7%94%b1-%e6%b3%95%e5%ae%98-%e9%ab%98%e7%ad%89%e6%b3%95%e9%99%a2-%e8%ac%80%e6%ae%ba%e6%a1%88-2453977/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案續審前法官解除1陪審員職務「不適合繼續擔任」理由曝光</a>\n</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e5%82%91-%e8%83%8c%e6%99%af-%e5%ad%b8%e6%ad%b7-%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e8%a6%aa%e5%85%84%e5%a6%b9-%e8%b5%b4%e7%be%8e%e5%8d%87%e5%ad%b8-%e6%9d%8e%e7%91%9e%e9%a6%99-%e9%84%ba-2453477/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜鄺港傑身世學歷家庭背景 8字剖白與蔡天鳳關係 母親李瑞香職業首曝光</a></p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e4%b8%bb%e6%8e%a7%e5%ae%98%e9%83%ad%e8%8e%8e%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">主控官郭莎樂</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e7%9c%8b%e5%9c%96%e4%bd%9c%e6%96%87/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">看圖作文</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e5%82%91/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄺港傑</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n圖片來源：IG@xxabbyc資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/2456137\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於SundayKiss</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e7%b6%b2%e7%b5%a1%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">網絡熱話</a>\nNov 17 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T17:46:13.900919+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1616,"images":1,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T16:08:28+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T23:38:39.878177+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T17:39:38.646525+00:00","content_hash":"23cf962b4593a2e1d938df264cf005e9ffc5431031061b64597d11d035e5dc54","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}